      <h1>Cruise Control: Frequency Domain Methods for Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/feedback.html"><tt>feedback</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/step.html"><tt>step</tt></a></p>
